    <!-- About -->
    <string name="mx_about_title">About Matixray</string>
    <string name="mx_about_body">Matixray is an upgraded build of V2Ray, made to connect fast and keep you connected.\n\nWhat it gives you:\n• Free configs: one tap on “Get configs” downloads Mahsa NG\'s public lists, tests every config on your own connection and keeps only the fastest working ones (about 20) in the Free group.\n• Groups and subscriptions: your own groups, subscription links, refresh and delete per group.\n• Xfinder and the IP scanner: finds clean IPs and can mix them into your configs.\n• Auto-connect: if the server drops, the app switches to the best working one.\n• Protocols: VMess, VLESS, Trojan, Shadowsocks, Hysteria2 and more, on the Xray core, with Psiphon and Aether.\n\nThe free configs come from the open lists of Mahsa NG and its community, whom we thank. Join our Telegram channel for news and updates.</string>
