    <string name="mx_fetch_only_working_title">Keep only working configs</string>
    <string name="mx_fetch_only_working_hint">After “Get configs” the app downloads Mahsa NG\'s lists, drops the servers that do not even open a connection, then tests the rest with a real connection test on your own network. Only the fastest working configs (about 20) stay in the Free group and the dead ones are deleted, so every config you see should connect. This takes a short while. Turn it off to keep everything that was downloaded, working or not.</string>
